WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:05.457
Liu Bei spun around and saw a fierce- looking

2
00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:09.499
man. He was tall with a wild

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.082
beard. His eyes were sharp—like the eyes of a

4
00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:20.414
panther. “You should fight the Yellow Turbans instead of just sighing about the

5
00:00:20.415 --> 00:00:27.374
problem.” The man stepped closer. “Or are you thinking about joining the

6
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:32.613
rebellion?” “No,” Liu Bei said. “I am loyal to Emperor

7
00:00:32.614 --> 00:00:36.413
Ling. I only sighed because I’m

8
00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:38.569
frustrated. My name is Liu

9
00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:43.309
Bei. And as a distant relative of the emperor, it’s my duty to fight for the

10
00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:48.952
Han. But I have no money to raise an

11
00:00:48.953 --> 00:00:53.074
army.” A wide grin spread across the man’s

12
00:00:53.075 --> 00:00:56.082
face. “We should work

13
00:00:56.083 --> 00:01:01.541
together!” “Are you serious?” Liu Bei did not expect

14
00:01:01.542 --> 00:01:06.209
this! The man nodded. “My name is Zhang

15
00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:09.389
Fei. My family has lots of

16
00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:16.178
money. I can pay for weapons, armor, horses, food . . . everything we’ll need.

17
00:01:16.179 --> 00:01:19.457
And you’re related to the Hans!

18
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:28.832
We’ll have no problem recruiting soldiers if you’re leading the army.”

19
00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:35.838
Liu Bei bowed. “Zhang Fei, I would be delighted to work with you.

20
00:01:35.839 --> 00:01:39.374
We must put together a plan.”

21
00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:45.541
“Excellent!” Zhang Fei said.

22
00:01:45.542 --> 00:01:49.207
Later the two men went to a pub.

23
00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:53.916
At the entrance a woman was scolding a man.

24
00:01:53.917 --> 00:01:57.017
“I can’t believe you won’t help the emperor.

25
00:01:57.018 --> 00:01:59.374
You should be ashamed.”

26
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:02.741
“I’m not ashamed,” the man said.

27
00:02:02.742 --> 00:02:06.624
“I’m going to join the Yellow Turbans.”

28
00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:11.793
Zhang Fei stomped over. “What did you say?”

29
00:02:11.794 --> 00:02:17.541
The man folded his arms. “You heard me.”

30
00:02:17.542 --> 00:02:23.749
Zhang Fei held up his spear. “Say it again!”

31
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:28.822
The man pulled out a knife. “I’m going to join the—”

32
00:02:28.823 --> 00:02:34.852
Whoosh! Zhang Fei swung his weapon, knocking the knife to the ground.

33
00:02:34.853 --> 00:02:41.624
He swung again and hit the man on the head with the spear’s wooden shaft. Bonk!

34
00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:48.707
“Ouch!” The man turned and ran out of the village.

35
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.548
The woman looked at Zhang Fei.

36
00:02:51.549 --> 00:02:56.457
“I’m so happy to see someone who is against the Yellow Turbans.”

37
00:02:56.458 --> 00:03:04.666
Zhang Fei bowed. Then he turned to Liu Bei. “We’re already winning.”

38
00:03:04.667 --> 00:03:12.126
The two men laughed and went into the pub.

39
00:03:12.127 --> 00:03:20.916
They sat down at a table in the corner.

40
00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:23.537
The owner brought them a drink.

41
00:03:23.538 --> 00:03:30.791
“There’s no charge for this. I saw how you handled that traitor outside.”

42
00:03:30.792 --> 00:03:34.978
Zhang Fei nodded. “Thank you.”

43
00:03:34.979 --> 00:03:38.874
The owner hurried over to another table.

44
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:43.250
“We’ll need a lot of soldiers,” Liu Bei said.

45
00:03:43.251 --> 00:03:46.124
“I’m sure you can train them.”

46
00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:51.613
“Of course!” Zhang Fei took a swig of his drink.

47
00:03:51.614 --> 00:03:56.535
“I’m quite strong—never lost a fight in my life.

48
00:03:56.536 --> 00:04:01.589
I can’t wait to fight those Yellow Turban good-for-nothings. I’ll

49
00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.653
destroy them all!” “Not

50
00:04:04.654 --> 00:04:09.491
if I destroy them first!” someone said. Liu

51
00:04:09.492 --> 00:04:14.366
Bei looked up and saw another fierce- looking man.

52
00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:19.791
He was even taller than Zhang Fei, with a much longer beard.

53
00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:25.624
“Who are you?” Zhang Fei asked.

54
00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:31.769
“My name is Guan Yu. I arrived in this village hoping to join an army.”

55
00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:35.343
The man puffed out his chest.

56
00:04:35.344 --> 00:04:39.480
“I, too, want to wipe out the Yellow Turbans.”

57
00:04:39.481 --> 00:04:43.304
“Excellent!” Liu Bei stood up.

58
00:04:43.305 --> 00:04:46.843
“I’m Liu Bei, and this is Zhang Fei. He is—”

59
00:04:46.844 --> 00:04:52.124
“The greatest fighter in the land!” Zhang Fei said.

60
00:04:52.125 --> 00:05:00.684
Guan Yu scoffed. “Well, I doubt that, because I am the greatest fighter in the land.”

61
00:05:00.685 --> 00:05:06.087
He narrowed his eyes. “I’m sure I could beat you.”

62
00:05:06.088 --> 00:05:09.375
Zhang Fei’s face filled with rage.

63
00:05:09.376 --> 00:05:19.313
He jumped to his feet and drew his spear!
